//- Rendered straight from the POST rather than reached by redirect, so the
//- reference never lands in a URL, a history entry or a referrer header.
extends layout

include partials/footer

block content
  main#content.legal.playtest(data-screen-label="Playtest application received")
    .wrap.legal__inner
      a.legal__home(href="/") ← Buried Worlds VR

      .section-head
        .ornament
          span.rule
          span.diamond
          span.rule
        h1.h2 Application received
        p.serif-italic Thank you. Nothing else is needed from you yet.

      .legal__body
        if reference
          .playtest-reference
            span.playtest-reference__label Your reference
            span.playtest-reference__code= reference
            span.playtest-reference__note Worth keeping. You will need it, with the email address you gave, to submit your session — and it is how to ask about your application without sending your details again.

        if duplicate
          p.admin-alert(role="status").
            You had already applied with that email address, so this did not create a
            second application — the reference above is your original one, and its
            place in the queue is unchanged.

        h2.legal__h What happens next
        ol.legal__list
          li Applications are read as they arrive, and selection is for a spread of headsets and VR experience.
          li.
            If you are selected you will get an email from us with a key for the game
            and a link to the brief. Redeem the key in the Meta Horizon app on the
            account you own the headset with; your #{study.deadlineLabel} starts
            from that email.
          li
            | The brief and the questions are already written —
            |  #[a(href="/playtest/questionnaire") you can read them now].
          li You submit your answers, a link to a clip or screenshots, and your #{study.payoutMethod} account on the questionnaire page — nothing is sent by email. Payment lands within #{study.paymentWindowHours} hours of it arriving.
        p.
          Please do not install, record or buy anything yet. Nothing you do before a
          place is offered and accepted is paid, and nothing is expected of you in the
          meantime.
        p.
          If you are not selected this round you will be told when selection closes,
          rather than left waiting. Not being picked is usually about which headsets
          were already covered.

        h2.legal__h Changing your mind
        p
          | Ask through the #[a(href="/privacy") privacy page], quoting your reference, and
          |  the application will be withdrawn and deleted. No reason is needed, and it
          |  costs you nothing.

        p.legal__meta(style="margin-top:40px")
          | Study terms version #{study.termsVersion}.

  +footer(links)
